# Playwright run artefacts. Never commit these.
#
# On 2 Sep 2026 a committed test-results/ tree turned out to contain page
# snapshots of an entirely different project, captured when the suite
# silently attached to a stray dev server on a shared port. Committed
# artefacts read as evidence long after the run that made them is
# forgotten, and stale ones are worse than none.
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
.playwright/
